                            "speziell Fitness"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7decdd2-9cfa-4f5e-aff0-44fe81f9dd91",
                                "sense_id": "162e0ad0-8df5-3aef-85ee-b6a2e2bb6689",
                                "text": "„Jeden Tag drei positive Erlebnisse zu notieren ist weniger anstrengend als ein Work-out im Fitness-Center oder ein MBA-Studium.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cec2575-fcd8-4277-8acc-05bb48bb86e9",
                        "source_entry_id": "36b205d8-e24a-31fe-ad3d-77c25db6212a",
                        "source_sense_id": "162e0ad0-8df5-3aef-85ee-b6a2e2bb6689",
                        "target_lang_word": "workout",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "workout",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eda6a0bb-7425-3a78-8be9-21b458251675",
                                        "entry_id": "f9adcc9b-600a-3197-9029-510e8cbea0d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exercise session; a period of physical exercise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88a93016-9665-4254-b14f-dd1e51e1a5b2",
                                                "sense_id": "eda6a0bb-7425-3a78-8be9-21b458251675",
                                                "text": "The following guidelines for smart weekly scheduling can simplify this piece of the planning: Swim three or four workouts each week."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "270a6b04-66f5-4997-bd1e-8e0b8322d6b7",
                                                "sense_id": "eda6a0bb-7425-3a78-8be9-21b458251675",
                                                "text": "Whether you need to recover from a stressful day, a strenuous workout or even an injury or surgery, restorative yoga may be just the thing for you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e22905f3-76bb-43eb-85b8-c7c6d7b8102d",
                                                "sense_id": "eda6a0bb-7425-3a78-8be9-21b458251675",
                                                "text": "More extroverted people, for example, prefer high-intensity training sessions with others, such as team sports, while people who scored highly on “neuroticism,” a metric that measures someone’s emotional instability, preferred private workouts without people watching them and punctuated by short breaks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8085c389-cfa8-3d7a-b758-632daf6288d0",
                                        "entry_id": "f9adcc9b-600a-3197-9029-510e8cbea0d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A schedule or program of specific exercises, especially one intended to achieve a particular goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b46fc618-12a7-4d4e-8f16-148d8e78483d",
                                                "sense_id": "8085c389-cfa8-3d7a-b758-632daf6288d0",
                                                "text": "If athletes do too much too soon, they will be stiff and sore 24 to 48 hours after a new workout."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162145cf-403e-4882-bdce-2db176fde00e",
                                                "sense_id": "8085c389-cfa8-3d7a-b758-632daf6288d0",
                                                "text": "I read in another magazine about a workout that can put a whole inch on your arms in just one day!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d13b209-0c0e-36b6-a498-cff4959ba441",
                                        "entry_id": "f9adcc9b-600a-3197-9029-510e8cbea0d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any activity that requires much physical or mental effort, or produces strain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "294fbd95-d35d-4d68-9b1e-2e2b26aa5ed7",
                                                "sense_id": "9d13b209-0c0e-36b6-a498-cff4959ba441",
                                                "text": "Cynthia's phone got a workout, as well. In approximately three days since the news had hit the street, a total of five bridal showers had been booked, not to mention a luncheon at Esther Cunningham's and tea at Olivia Harper's."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4587fef2-0674-4c27-b352-c6c2c62d480b",
                                                "sense_id": "9d13b209-0c0e-36b6-a498-cff4959ba441",
                                                "text": "After the camera pans around and we welcome back a lot of familiar faces (Edmure Tully! Yara Greyjoy! Brienne!), the themes of opposition to fate, emotional appeals, and ethical duty get an even better workout."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
